        "slc_ad4832ef534fa7c36f076bd6a55598ac2ecd4b7c924961cee51b35da0dd1bd54"
      ],
      "text": "LangSmith is the default sandbox and tracing provider; Modal, Daytona, Runloop, E2B, and local execution are also supported via a pluggable provider interface selected by the SANDBOX_TYPE environment variable."
    },
    {
