      "text": "For LangSmith sandboxes, GitHub proxy rules give github.com Basic auth for git-over-HTTPS and api.github.com Bearer auth for gh/REST; the proxy token is minted at runtime from GitHub App installation credentials rather than stored as env vars."
    },
