      "text": "Model defaults are configurable via LLM_MODEL_ID and LLM_REASONING_EFFORT; an Anthropic-only deployment defaults to anthropic:claude-opus-5, other deployments to openai:gpt-5.6-sol, with default reasoning effort medium."
